<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Carson Pirie started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Carson Pirie started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lazard Freres &amp; Co said it initiated coverage of Carson Pirie Scott &amp; Co with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- said Carson Pirie is the &quot;focus stock&quot; retail pick for 1997.</p>
<p>-- said expects earnings growth of 11-12 percent annually, excluding acquisitions.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $34 a share.</p>
<p>-- said Carson Pirie is one of the &quot;strongest and well-positioned regional department store franchises.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Carson Pirie gained 1/4 to 26-3/8 in morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
